    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear what you're saying, but it doesn't feel like an \"evolution\" to me. it feels like i'm just a parasite on their achievements. if a beautiful tapestry has one rotten thread, you don't keep it just to say it's \"part of the mess,\" you cut it out so the rest of the fabric can stay intact. wouldn't it be more honorable to just step aside and let the integrity of the family name stay pure without my shadow over it?",
